### flashcards

credit to [eudoxia0/hashcards](https://github.com/eudoxia0/hashcards). Check out [an example set of flashcards on sets theory](/thoughts/Sets.fc). Decks support question/answer and cloze cards, math, and stable card identities. The source note can sit beside the active card, and a course review combines due cards from its decks. Signed-in owner reviews use [FSRS](https://github.com/open-spaced-repetition/ts-fsrs), with saved review history and undo. Grading a cloze card defers its siblings until the next session.
